\section{High-level orchestration}{

\code{\link[=nwsrfs_run]{nwsrfs_run()}} reads NWRFC autocalibration directories and runs the full
model chain. \code{\link[=load_example]{load_example()}} provides bundled example data for NRKW1 and SFLN2.
